    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll are delighted to present No. 31 Ath Lethan to the market for sale a spacious, four-bedroom, three-storey, mid-terraced house situated within a well-established residential location. \n\nThe property is conveniently located on the Racecourse Road, within easy reach of Dundalk Town Centre and a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops, recreational facilities and transport links. In addition, its location also provides convenient access to the M1 Motorway Junction 18 making Dublin and Belfast readily accessible and suitable for commuters or those operating on a hybrid working basis.\n\nExtending to approximately 139 sq.m. / 1,500 sq.ft. approx., the property offers well-proportioned accommodation arranged over three floors, making it an ideal home for families or those seeking their next investment property. This layout provides excellent flexibility, with four bedrooms and ample living space throughout.\n\nExternally, the property is adjacent a large green space and benefits from lawns and off-street parking to the front together with together with an enclosed garden and patio at the rear -providing an excellent outdoor space for entertaining or al-fresco dining during the summer months. \n\nThis is a well-proportioned home offering excellent accommodation, generous outdoor space and a convenient residential location ready for its new owners to make it their own. \n\nViewing by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.07m x 3.08m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.24m x 4.38m\n\n\nW.C. - 1.98m x 1.48m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom - 5.16m x 2.64m\n\n\nBedroom - 5.16m x 3.04m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.70m x 2.18m\n\n\nSECOND FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom - 5.16m x 4.04m\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.64m x 1.68m\n\n\nDressing Room - 1.70m x 1.50m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.38m x 2.64m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 139 sq.m. / 1,496 sq.ft. approx.\n\n"
      },
      {
